entry('deli_meat_uncured').science = 'Celery powder or juice supplies nitrate that becomes nitrite during curing. The ingredient list and qualifier name that source on “uncured” meat. Phosphates hold water in the meat, while carrageenan and starch bind or thicken it. Whole roasted meat leaves out the cure; counter slicing alone changes none of the ingredients.';
